  "slug": "liquidity",
  "title_en": "Understanding the Liquidity Board: Lowest Friction In and Out",
  "excerpt_en": "Ranked by tightest bid-ask spreads—the contracts where round-trip cost won't eat your edge.",
  "body_en": "<!-- ===== OptionsAji 博客片段：流动性榜使用说明 ===== -->\n<style>\n  .aji-guide{--bg:#f5f2f0;--ink:#151617;--gold:#c9a227;--card:#fffdfb;--line:#e7e1d8;--muted:#6f6a63;--soft:#c9c2b6;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;line-height:1.75;font-size:16px;padding:4px}\n  .aji-guide h2{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2px}\n  .aji-guide h3{font-size:18px;margin:26px 0 8px;font-weight:700}\n  .aji-guide p{margin:10px 0}.aji-guide .lead{font-size:17px}\n  .aji-guide .accent{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}\n  .aji-guide .chart-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 22px;margin:22px 0;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(21,22,23,.05)}\n  .aji-guide .chart-note{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 14px}\n  .aji-guide canvas{max-width:100%}\n  .aji-guide .analogy{border-left:4px solid var(--gold);background:rgba(201,162,39,.07);padding:12px 16px;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;margin:16px 0}\n  .aji-guide .formula{background:#151617;color:#f5f2f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;overflow-x:auto}\n  .aji-guide .formula b{color:var(--gold)}\n  .aji-guide .data-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:14.5px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px}\n  .aji-guide .data-table th{background:var(--ink);color:#f5f2f0;text-align:left;padding:11px 14px;font-weight:600}\n  .aji-guide .data-table td{padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}\n  .aji-guide .data-table tr:nth-child(even) td{background:rgba(201,162,39,.035)}\n  .aji-guide .data-table .col{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap}\n  .aji-guide .tag{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:20px}\n  .aji-guide .tag-core{background:var(--gold);color:#fff}.aji-guide .tag-base{background:var(--soft);color:var(--ink)}\n  .aji-guide .calc{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:flex-end;margin:8px 0 4px}\n  .aji-guide .calc label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);gap:5px}\n  .aji-guide .calc input{width:140px;padding:9px 11px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}\n  .aji-guide .calc input:focus{outline:2px solid var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold)}\n  .aji-guide .verdict{margin-top:16px;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;background:rgba(201,162,39,.12)}\n  .aji-guide .big-num{font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:var(--gold);display:block;line-height:1.15}\n  .aji-guide .disclaimer{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:26px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n  .aji-guide .cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--gold);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(201,162,39,.3);transition:background .15s}\n  .aji-guide .cta:hover{background:#b8911f}\n  .aji-guide .cta-row{margin:16px 0 4px}\n  .aji-guide .cta-bottom{background:rgba(201,162,39,.08);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;margin:24px 0 8px;text-align:center}\n  .aji-guide .cta-bottom p{margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aji-guide\">\n  <h2>Understanding the Liquidity Board: Lowest Friction In and Out</h2>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Even great signals fail if the <span class=\"accent\">bid-ask spread is wide</span>. This board ranks contracts by <b>tightest spread and smoothest execution</b>—avoiding traps that look profitable until you pay the toll.</p>\n  <div class=\"cta-row\"><a class=\"cta\" href=\"https://www.options-aji.com/options/liquidity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📊 Open live Liquidity board →</a></div>\n  <h3>1. Spread = Your Round-Trip Toll</h3>\n  <div class=\"analogy\"><p style=\"margin:4px 0\"><b>Bid</b>: what the market pays you; <b>Ask</b>: what you pay to buy.</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:4px 0\">You usually buy at Ask and sell at Bid—the gap is friction. <span class=\"accent\">Narrower spread = less slippage.</span></p></div>\n  <div class=\"formula\">Mid = (Bid + Ask) / 2<br>Spread% = (Ask − Bid) / Mid × 100<br>Round-trip cost ≈ one full spread<br><b>Ex</b>: Bid $1.00 / Ask $1.10 → spread ≈ <b>9.5%</b></div>\n  <div class=\"chart-card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:18px\">Spread% Comparison: Lower Is Better (example)</h2><p class=\"chart-note\">Gold = tight; gray = wide. Rendered with Chart.js via jsDelivr CDN only.</p><canvas id=\"lqSpread\" width=\"640\" height=\"300\" aria-label=\"Spread comparison\"></canvas></div>\n  <h3>2. Try It: What's Your Toll?</h3>\n  <div class=\"chart-card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:18px\">🧮 Spread Cost Calculator</h2><p class=\"chart-note\">Enter Bid/Ask locally—no network calls.</p>\n  <div class=\"calc\"><label>Bid ($)<input id=\"lqBid\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"1.00\" inputmode=\"decimal\"></label>\n  <label>Ask ($)<input id=\"lqAsk\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"1.10\" inputmode=\"decimal\"></label></div>\n  <div class=\"verdict\" id=\"lqOut\"></div></div>\n  <h3>3. Column Guide</h3>\n  <table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Column</th><th>Meaning</th><th>How to use</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">#</td><td>Rank by liquidity (tightest spread first).</td><td>Top = smoothest.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Contract</td><td>Symbol, expiry, strike, side.</td><td>ETFs and mega-cap near-month usually best.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Bid / Ask</td><td>Current quotes.</td><td>Your fills land here.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Spread <span class=\"tag tag-core\">Core</span></td><td>Ask − Bid.</td><td>Smaller is better.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Spread% <span class=\"tag tag-core\">Core</span></td><td>Spread / mid—sort key.</td><td><span class=\"accent\">Fair compare across prices</span>.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Volume / OI</td><td>Activity and inventory.</td><td>More = stabler quotes.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Depth <span class=\"tag tag-base\">Aux</span></td><td>Size at bid/ask.</td><td>Thick book = less impact.</td></tr>\n  </tbody></table>\n  <h3>4. Three Reminders</h3>\n  <p><b>1. Check liquidity before strategy.</b><br><b>2. Use limit orders, not market orders</b> on wide names.<br><b>3. Spreads widen off-hours, near expiry, and in shocks.</b></p>\n  <div class=\"cta-bottom\"><p>Ready to explore? See today's live data 👇</p><a class=\"cta\" href=\"https://www.options-aji.com/options/liquidity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📊 Open live Liquidity board →</a></div><p class=\"disclaimer\">Data may be delayed ~15 minutes. For research only—not investment advice. Options trading involves substantial risk of loss. © OptionsAji</p>\n\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.1/dist/chart.umd.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  if(typeof Chart==='undefined')return;\n  var GOLD='#c9a227',GRAY='#c9c2b6',INK='#151617';\n  var labels=['SPY C','QQQ P','AAPL C','NVDA C','冷门小票 C'];\n  var sp=[0.6,0.9,1.8,2.5,14.0];\n  var c1=document.getElementById('lqSpread');\n  if(c1){new Chart(c1,{type:'bar',data:{labels:labels,datasets:[{label:'Spread %',data:sp,backgroundColor:sp.map(function(v){return v<=3?GOLD:GRAY;}),borderRadius:4}]},\n    options:{indexAxis:'y',responsive:true,plugins:{legend:{display:false},tooltip:{callbacks:{label:function(i){return 'Spread '+i.parsed.x+'%'+(i.parsed.x<=3?' (smooth)':' (high friction)');}}}},\n    scales:{x:{ticks:{color:INK,callback:function(v){return v+'%';}},grid:{color:'rgba(21,22,23,.06)'},title:{display:true,text:'Bid-ask spread % (lower is better)',color:INK}},y:{ticks:{color:INK},grid:{display:false}}}}});}\n  var b=document.getElementById('lqBid'),a=document.getElementById('lqAsk'),out=document.getElementById('lqOut');\n  function render(){\n    if(!out)return;\n    var bid=parseFloat(b.value),ask=parseFloat(a.value);\n    if(!(bid>=0)||!(ask>=0)||ask<bid){out.style.background='rgba(21,22,23,.05)';out.style.color='#6f6a63';out.innerHTML='Enter valid quotes (Ask must be ≥ Bid).';return;}\n    var mid=(bid+ask)/2, spread=ask-bid, pct=mid>0?spread/mid*100:0;\n    var verdict = pct<=3?'Good liquidity, smooth execution ✅':pct<=8?'Fair—use limit orders 🔸':'High friction—be careful ⚠️';\n    out.style.background='rgba(201,162,39,.12)';out.style.color='#151617';\n    out.innerHTML='Spread $'+spread.toFixed(2)+'，价差率 <span class=\"big-num\">'+pct.toFixed(1)+'%</span>中间价 $'+mid.toFixed(2)+'. Round-trip cost ≈ '+pct.toFixed(1)+'% 的过路费——'+verdict;\n  }\n  if(b&&a){b.addEventListener('input',render);a.addEventListener('input',render);render();}\n})();\n</script>\n<!-- ===== /片段结束 ===== -->"
}
